  "description": "Oliver \"Livy\" Oyle isn't the brightest bulb in the aristocracy, but he knows beauty when he sees it. When the mysterious Diesel joins the household staff, Livy is convinced he’s found his soulmate. He’s so blinded by Diesel's gorgeous face that he ignores the maid's massive shoulders and sharp tongue. Little does he know, Diesel is actually the exiled Prince Canol, a man sworn to destroy his family. Between Livy’s clumsy advances and Canol’s secret agenda, the Oyle estate is about to become the stage for a very confusing, very steamy comedy of errors.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
